{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implemented and pushed to Gerrit as change 1776 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1776).\n\nHeld-out RED oracle tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_outbound_multi_project.py (11 tests) confirmed RED for the right reasons, now GREEN. Mutation-checked: removing the differ stamp, removing the not-synced/foreign-project gate, removing the DC key drop, and reverting the guard set-normalization each returned the relevant tests to RED.\n\nChanges across 5 files: outbound_differ.py (OutboundDiffConfig.projects_mapping + resolve/stamp on the create path under reserved key _bridge_target_project; not-synced/foreign-project emits no create), run_differs.py (load_mapping threaded into the config), acli.py + jira_datacenter/_issues.py (both transports read the reserved key; DC drops it via _BRIDGE_ONLY_CREATE_FIELDS), applier.py (cross-project guard accepts the store's project SET, falls back to single project for unseeded stores).\n\nBlast radius: full tests/unit/rebar_reconciler suite (2716 passed), no-resurrection create-path test (9 passed), existing cross-project guard test green (str-signature compat preserved). make lint + make typecheck clean. All modules under the 800-LOC cap (applier 778). Awaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 before Submit + close."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786720145638393001,"uuid":"de753915-94f9-41cb-b560-23b01ef9201d"}